\p \v 22 \w Then tell|strong="H00559"\w* \w Pharaoh that|strong="H06547"\w* \w this is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: ‘\w Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w is My firstborn|strong="H01060"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w*, \v 23 \w and I told you|strong="H00559"\w* \w to let My son|strong="H01121"\w* \w go|strong="H07971"\w* \w so that he may worship Me|strong="H05647"\w*. \w But since you have refused|strong="H03985"\w* \w to let him go|strong="H07971"\w*, \w behold|strong="H02009"\w*, \w I|strong="H00595"\w* \w will kill|strong="H02026"\w* \w your firstborn|strong="H01060"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w*!’”
\p \v 24 \w Now at a lodging place|strong="H04411"\w* \w along the way|strong="H01870"\w*, \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w met Moses|strong="H06298"\w*\f + \fr 4:24 \ft Hebrew \fqa him\f* \w and was about|strong="H01245"\w* \w to kill him|strong="H04191"\w*. \v 25 \w But Zipporah|strong="H06855"\w* \w took|strong="H03947"\w* \w a flint knife|strong="H06864"\w*, \w cut off|strong="H03772"\w* \w her son’s|strong="H01121"\w* \w foreskin|strong="H06190"\w*, \w and touched it|strong="H05060"\w* \w to Moses’ feet|strong="H07272"\w*.\f + \fr 4:25 \ft Hebrew \fqa his feet\f* “\w Surely|strong="H03588"\w* \w you are|strong="H00859"\w* \w a bridegroom|strong="H02860"\w* \w of blood|strong="H01818"\w* to me,” \w she said|strong="H00559"\w*.
