\p \v 27 \w Meanwhile, the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w had said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Aaron|strong="H00175"\w*, “\w Go|strong="H01980"\w* \w and meet|strong="H07122"\w* \w Moses|strong="H04872"\w* \w in the wilderness|strong="H04057"\w*.” \w So he went|strong="H01980"\w* \w and met Moses|strong="H06298"\w* \w at the mountain|strong="H02022"\w* \w of God|strong="H00430"\w* \w and kissed|strong="H05401"\w* him. \v 28 \w And Moses|strong="H04872"\w* \w told|strong="H05046"\w* \w Aaron|strong="H00175"\w* \w everything|strong="H03605"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w had sent him|strong="H07971"\w* \w to say|strong="H00853"\w*, \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the signs|strong="H00226"\w* \w He had commanded him to perform|strong="H06680"\w*.
