015"\w* \w to blood|strong="H01818"\w*. \v 18 \w The fish|strong="H01710"\w* \w in the Nile|strong="H02975"\w* \w will die|strong="H04191"\w*, \w the river|strong="H02975"\w* \w will stink|strong="H00887"\w*, \w and the Egyptians|strong="H04713"\w* \w will be unable|strong="H03811"\w* \w to drink|strong="H08354"\w* \w its|strong="H02975"\w* \w water|strong="H04325"\w*.’”
