\p \v 10 \w For six|strong="H08337"\w* \w years|strong="H08141"\w* \w you are to sow|strong="H02232"\w* \w your land|strong="H00776"\w* \w and gather|strong="H00622"\w* \w its produce|strong="H08393"\w*, \v 11 \w but in the seventh year|strong="H07637"\w* \w you must let it rest|strong="H08058"\w* \w and lie fallow|strong="H05203"\w*, \w so that the poor|strong="H00034"\w* \w among your people|strong="H05971"\w* \w may eat|strong="H00398"\w* \w from the field|strong="H07704"\w* \w and the wild animals|strong="H02416"\w* \w may consume|strong="H00398"\w* \w what they leave|strong="H03499"\w*. \w Do|strong="H06213"\w* \w the same|strong="H03651"\w* \w with your vineyard|strong="H03754"\w* \w and olive grove|strong="H02132"\w*.
