\p \v 17 \w And you are to construct|strong="H06213"\w* \w a mercy seat|strong="H03727"\w*\f + \fr 25:17 \ft Or \fqa an atonement cover\ft ; here and throughout Exodus\f* \w of pure|strong="H02889"\w* \w gold|strong="H02091"\w*, \w two|strong="H00520"\w* \w and a half cubits|strong="H02677"\w* \w long|strong="H00753"\w* \w and a cubit|strong="H00520"\w* \w and a half|strong="H02677"\w* \w wide|strong="H07341"\w*.\f + \fr 25:17 \ft The mercy seat was approximately 3.75 feet long and 2.25 feet wide (114.3 centimeters long and 68.6 centimeters wide).\f* \v 18 \w Make|strong="H06213"\w* \w two|strong="H08147"\w* \w cherubim|strong="H03742"\w* \w of hammered|strong="H04749"\w* \w gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w at the|strong="H08147"\w* \w ends|strong="H07098"\w* \w of the mercy seat|strong="H03727"\w*, \v 19 \w one|strong="H00259"\w* \w cherub|strong="H03742"\w* \w on one|strong="H02088"\w* \w end|strong="H07098"\w* \w and one|strong="H00259"\w* \w on the other|strong="H07098"\w*, \w all made|strong="H06213"\w* \w from one piece of gold|strong="H07098"\w*. \v 20 \w And the cherubim|strong="H03742"\w* \w are to have|strong="H01961"\w* \w wings|strong="H03671"\w* \w that spread|strong="H06566"\w* \w upward|strong="H04605"\w*, \w overshadowing|strong="H05526"\w* \w the mercy seat|strong="H03727"\w*. \w The cherubim are to face|strong="H06440"\w* \w each|strong="H00376"\w* \w other|strong="H00251"\w*, \w looking|strong="H01961"\w* \w toward|strong="H00413"\w* \w the mercy seat|strong="H03727"\w*.
