\s1 Additional Priestly Garments
\r (Exodus 39:22–31)
\p \v 31 \w You are to make|strong="H06213"\w* \w the robe|strong="H04598"\w* \w of the ephod|strong="H00646"\w* \w entirely|strong="H03632"\w* \w of blue cloth|strong="H08504"\w*, \v 32 \w with|strong="H01961"\w* \w an opening|strong="H06310"\w* \w at its top|strong="H07218"\w* \w in the center|strong="H08432"\w*. \w Around the opening|strong="H05439"\w* \w shall be|strong="H01961"\w* \w a woven|strong="H04639"\w* \w collar|strong="H08193"\w* \w with an opening|strong="H06310"\w* \w like that|strong="H06310"\w* \w of a garment|strong="H08473"\w*,\f + \fr 28:32 \ft The meaning of the Hebrew word is uncertain; possibly \fqa a coat of mail\ft .\f* \w so that|strong="H01961"\w* it \w will not|strong="H03808"\w* \w tear|strong="H07167"\w*.
\p \v 33 \w Make|strong="H06213"\w* \w pomegranates|strong="H07416"\w* \w of blue|strong="H08504"\w*, \w purple|strong="H00713"\w*, \w and scarlet yarn|strong="H08438"\w* \w all the way around the lower|strong="H05439"\w* \w hem|strong="H07757"\w*, \w with gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w bells|strong="H06472"\w* \w between|strong="H08432"\w* \w them|strong="H05439"\w*, \v 34 \w alternating|strong="H05439"\w* \w the gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w bells|strong="H06472"\w* \w and pomegranates|strong="H07416"\w* \w around the lower hem|strong="H07757"\w* \w of the robe|strong="H04598"\w*.
\p \v 35 \w Aaron|strong="H00175"\w* \w must wear the robe|strong="H05921"\w* \w whenever he ministers|strong="H08334"\w*, \w and its sound|strong="H06963"\w* \w will be heard|strong="H08085"\w* \w when he enters|strong="H00935"\w* \w or exits|strong="H03318"\w* \w the sanctuary|strong="H06944"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, \w so that he will not|strong="H03808"\w* \w die|strong="H04191"\w*.
\p \v 36 \w You are to make|strong="H06213"\w* \w a plate|strong="H06731"\w* \w of pure|strong="H02889"\w* \w gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w and engrave|strong="H06605"\w* \w on it|strong="H05921"\w* \w as|strong="H06603"\w* \w on a seal|strong="H02368"\w*:
