\p \v 10 \w Let every|strong="H03605"\w* \w skilled craftsman|strong="H02450"\w* among you \w come|strong="H00935"\w* \w and make|strong="H06213"\w* \w everything|strong="H03605"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w has commanded|strong="H06680"\w*:
